OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual agricultural show welcomes
OL,4,Athousands
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of an annual agricultural
OL,7,Fshow say it has come back bigger and
OL,8,Fbetter with visitor numbers expected to
OL,9,Ftop 35,000.
OL,11,FThe Newbury Show showcases the best of
OL,12,Flocal agriculture including livestock,
OL,13,Frural crafts and hands-on activities.
OL,15,FOrganisers the Newbury and District
OL,16,FAgricultural Society (NADAS) said it
OL,17,Fhoped the show would bridge the gap
OL,18,Fbetween farmers and the wider
OL,19,Fcommunity.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
